# CCDV-F Practice Bank — Set 1 of 4 (Q1–Q60)

Built against Anthropic's official **CCDV-F Exam Guide v1.0** (July 2026), 25 sub-skills  
across 8 domains.
This is Set 1 of a 240-question, 4-set bank. Each set independently mirrors the real exam's  
item count (53→scaled to 60) and domain/sub-skill weighting, so each set is a full timed  
mock on its own.

**Design rule for every question in this bank:** all four (or five) options are real,  
correct strategies *somewhere* — never an absurd option. The wrong answers are wrong because  
they solve a nearby-but-different problem, not because they're bad ideas in general. If an  
option feels safe to eliminate on vibes, that's a sign to re-read the scenario, not the  
option.

Recommended: 108 minutes (proportional to the real exam's 120 min ÷ 53 × 60), closed-book,  
then grade against the key at the bottom.

